			<div class="content" id="post-content-4265734">
									

<p>Bit late but I wanted to post my thanks to the people that helped me through many different drafts of this work, the final product is extremely different to what it was at the beginning and I thank <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3009022); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3009022&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1559535859" alt="not_a_seagull" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3009022)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3009022); return false;">not_a_seagull</a></span> immensely for that.</p>
<p>Also thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/akfrost" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2070817); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2070817&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1559535859" alt="AKFrost" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2070817)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/akfrost" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2070817); return false;">AKFrost</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thebluehour" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4078000); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4078000&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1559535859" alt="TheBlueHour" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4078000)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thebluehour" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4078000); return false;">TheBlueHour</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drchandra" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1956625); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1956625&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1559535859" alt="DrChandra" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1956625)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drchandra" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1956625); return false;">DrChandra</a></span> for their critiques earlier on in the drafting process.</p>
<p>In case anyone was wondering the inspiration for this article came from about four of my mates living in houses that have the exact same floor plan and it's always been a running joke among our mates that some weird stuff happened to make this a popular floor plan. The house in the image is one of these mates and I thank him for allowing me to use the image.</p>

